      "layer": "types",
      "status": "proposed",
      "capabilityIds": [
        "eg.asr-provider",
        "eg.tts-provider"
      ],
      "summary": "Provider implementations of the frozen `asr.*` and `tts.*` contracts eg-audio declares. They are the only crates in the workspace that compile a vendored C/C++ library (whisper.cpp/ggml via whisper-rs-sys), which is why the repo's CPU-portability contract (GGML_NATIVE=OFF and the explicit GGML_BMI2=OFF in .cargo/config.toml) exists; the fleet's hosts are pre-AVX2. Providers never decide policy and never own a mutation scope."
    },
