      "summary": "The native time-series store and its TS primitives (time_bucket / ASOF / gap-fill / OHLC / rollup / decay_weighted_mean). Owns its own native mutation scope. Its crate Cargo.toml states outright that depending on eg-core AND eg-compute 'puts eg-tsdb ABOVE eg-compute in the DAG -- parallel to where eg-query sits', which is why D-EG-002 rules the LAYER assignment wrong rather than the edge."
    },
